Set the Key Vault URL environment variable:

```bash
# Windows (PowerShell)
$env:KEY_VAULT_URL="https://your-keyvault-name.vault.azure.net/"

# Windows (CMD)
set KEY_VAULT_URL=https://your-keyvault-name.vault.azure.net/

