await blockBlobClient.upload(content, length);

// 4. Error handling
try {
  // operations...
} catch (error) {
  if (error instanceof RestError) {
    // Handle Azure-specific errors
  }
}
```

## Required NPM Packages

| Package | Version | Purpose |
