+ * 
+ * Flow:
+ * 1. Configure Azure clients (Blob Storage + Key Vault)
+ * 2. Encrypt a sample string and upload to Blob Storage
+ * 3. Download and decrypt the blob
+ * 4. Verify the round-trip succeeded
+ */
+async function main() {
